cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "High Plains Open Energy Data"
abstract: >-
  Open, checked data on the energy system of Wyoming: generators, generation and in-state sales, a tracker of
  proposed and retiring generators, the history of planned coal retirement dates, and the Wyoming interconnection
  queue, with teaching material built on the same data. Derived from the Public Utility Data Liberation project
  (Catalyst Cooperative), U.S. EIA Forms 860, 861 and 923, and Berkeley Lab's Queued Up data file.
authors:
  - family-names: Parsons
    given-names: Noah
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-7224-6040"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://high-plains-open-energy-data.github.io"
repository-code: "https://github.com/high-plains-open-energy-data/high-plains-open-energy-data.github.io"
keywords:
  - Wyoming
  - electricity
  - open data
  - EIA-860
  - interconnection queue
  - coal retirement
